div.p:
Brit have tentatively set up fol timetable for TCC exercise. This working level paper. On basis of this timetable
                    they suggest later date for Rome mtg wld be desirable, although will not press
                    this point. Generally they have considered that Rome mtg shld come after TCC report is finalized. I suggested utility of
                    council mtg during TCC operation, which they
                    will consider. Fol is suggested timetable: 

“(a) First mtg of the Comite of Twelve
                            and of the Executive Bureau: October 10;

“(b) Examination of screened defense
                            costs of current programs and of forces for the full MTDP: October 16 to 18;

“(c) Assessment of the military risks
                            involved if defense efforts are not increased: October 20 to 21;

“(d) Submission of countries memoranda on
                            the economics consequences of present and required defense programs:
                            October 27;

“(e) Examination of the memoranda at (d) above: October 29 to 31;

“(f) Drafting report: November 1 to
                            5;

“(g) Completion of draft report and
                            submission to Comite of Twelve: November 10;

“(h) Examination by Comite of Twelve of
                            the report by the Executive Bureau: 11 to 18.”
